{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/98366-god-machine-rules-or-default-nwod-and-crossovers","id":98366,"title":"God Machine rules or Default nWoD, and Crossovers?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-25T08:15:12-07:00","id":98366,"title":"God Machine rules or Default nWoD, and Crossovers?","content":"I have a few questions I would like answered before I order DtD through Drivethrurpg (Though I will probably order it anyway), I am hoping someone could answer them for me.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> Does Demon use both rule sets or just God Machine?<br /> <br /> If its only God Machine, is there a way to run it in the Vanilla rules, mainly for a Nwod Crossover with the Uratha, Mages, Slasher and Kindred?<br /> <br /> How good are the new Demons in crossovers with other races? Do they have a severely limiting factor, such as the mummys short life spawn, or the Garou and Kindreds utter hatred for each other in oWoD?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2448-dante","name":"Dante","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2448_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T08:26:49-07:00","id":98377,"title":"","content":"Demons don't really have hard limiting factor per se, (like, the Kindred not being able to do a whole lot during the daytime, which is a huge hassle in crossover games) but their actions do relate a lot with the God Machine and its angels, which are... dangerous and inconvenient to say the least. It's more like the problems mages have with the Seers, but in the case of the demons more intrinsic. I mean, if the other splats don't mind dealing with the God Machine and the angels much, they are not going to be a lot of problems. But do bear in mind that a lot of demonic stuff do depend on the God Machine story arc.<br /> <br /> If you don't want to deal with the God Machine to much, I'd suggest to at least incorporate from the Demon: the Fallen Translation Guide, (soon to come, right? right?) because there are similarities, and they won't rely too much on the God Machine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1229-torete","name":"torete","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1229_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"125"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T09:30:43-07:00","id":98417,"title":"","content":"Demon uses (and includes) the God-Machine rule update. That said, it would be super easy (with one main exception) to use it with the earlier ruleset with these changes:<br /> <br /> Embeds and Exploits each cost 10 xp.<br /> Primum costs new dotes x 8.<br /> Any demon specific condition that rewards a beat on resolution, instead grants 1 xp.<br /> <br /> The tricky thing is the pact system as it relates to cover and cover experience. That system is not very compatible with the old xp chart. I'd maintain that as a separate system using the rules as written in the Demon book. I would not allow regular experience to buy cover points.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":61,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","user":"Octavo","date":". 03-25-2014, 12:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T13:02:07-07:00","id":98586,"title":"","content":"Unless you have an objection to the new rules, vampires have Blood and Smoke. I think it'd probably be easier to hack something together for the other splats based on that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2037-iceix","name":"IceIX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2037_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T16:05:21-07:00","id":98736,"title":"","content":"Plus Werewolf and Mage both have GMC era updates in the works as well. Hunter is seeing at least a partial update in its next book (though it doesn't seem to be getting a full fledged Chronicle book like the others) and it isn't like Slashers are super rules heavy to begin with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T16:44:31-07:00","id":98765,"title":"","content":"My ST doesn't own any of the God Machine stuff, and the only thing he has seen is B&amp;S where he preferred to keep it the same rules but used the new sunlight and coils rules.<br /> He would more rather someone find a way to bring demons to the old system then him having to change all the Draculs and having to reteach the system to the entire table, since I am the only one who owns B&amp;S at my table. (Which I have barley even read, Mummy has been keeping all of my attention.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2448-dante","name":"Dante","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2448_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T04:55:40-07:00","id":99060,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dante</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/98366-god-machine-rules-or-default-nwod-and-crossovers?p=98765#post98765\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My ST doesn't own any of the God Machine stuff, and the only thing he has seen is B&amp;S where he preferred to keep it the same rules but used the new sunlight and coils rules.<br /> He would more rather someone find a way to bring demons to the old system then him having to change all the Draculs and having to reteach the system to the entire table, since I am the only one who owns B&amp;S at my table. (Which I have barley even read, Mummy has been keeping all of my attention.)</div> </div> </div> </div> Ew... mummy. <br /> <br /> Just kidding. Anyways. Backwards converting is actually not hard. The biggest changes with GMC updates, I think, are 1) combat, 2) conditions, 3) social stuff with doors, and 4) how exp works. I don't recall Demon having any powers that reference doors. All the demon combat powers can work with old combat rules. Exp can just be swapped over. Conditions integrated with little problems. <br /> <br /> So, despite it being GMC, its not that difficult to use with the old rule set.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T09:41:29-07:00","id":99238,"title":"","content":"To use Conditions with first edition nWoD, I recommend giving Willpower instead of Beats. That's what I do for one-shots.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T19:03:59-07:00","id":99643,"title":"","content":"Since were on the topic... I plan on running some players on a vampire requiem game with (nwod rules) the danse de la morte chronicle and making up what happens when katrina hits to cap it off. Then I'll run them on Demon but they are pretty hesitant about the GMC rules. Personally, the only thing in there I really dont like is the change from damage just added to your attack dice. Has anyone actully run Demon with old rules? If so, how smooth did it go?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/284-mason","name":"Mason","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar284_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-15T21:12:11-08:00","id":341507,"title":"","content":"Hi,<br /> In the nine or so months since the last post on this subject. Does anyone have any more (or updated) ideas on how one should convert DtD for use in 1st ed. nWoD? <br /> <br /> Is this still the best chart?:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Embeds and Exploits each cost 10 xp.<br /> Primum costs new dotes x 8.<br /> Any demon specific condition that rewards a beat on resolution, instead grants a willpower </div> </div> </div>Thanks!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3599-antipop","name":"antipop","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-16T01:15:32-08:00","id":341644,"title":"","content":"That would be the chart I use.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/c